//label(scale(0.8)*"$17$", (70, 15));

[/asy]

Since 12 people have cool dads and 9 of those have cool moms, too, $12-9=3$ of the people have cool dads and uncool moms.  Likewise, $15-9=6$ people have cool moms and uncool dads.

[asy]

