draw(Circle((2,1),0.15),red);
draw(Circle((1,2),0.15),red);
draw(Circle((2,2),0.15),red);
draw(Circle((3,2),0.15),red);
draw(Circle((2,3),0.15),red);

for (i = -1; i <= 4; ++i) {
for (j = -1; j <= 4; ++j) {
  dot((i,j));
}}
[/asy]

We see that there are $\boxed{6}$ lattice points that lie inside all three circles.

